---@class posthog.tracing.SymbolStatsQueryBody
---@field filePath string Repo-relative path of the source file to aggregate (e.g. 'src/flags/flag_matching.rs'). Matched as a path suffix against the recorded OTel code.file.path / code.filepath, so a recorded path carrying an extra crate/workspace prefix still matches. Separators are normalized.
---@field dateRange? posthog.tracing.TracingDateRange Current period to aggregate over; the prior equal-length window is the comparison. Defaults to last 24h.
---@field symbols? posthog.tracing.SymbolStatsQueryBodySymbolsList Optional symbol (function) line ranges, supplied by the client from its own AST/LSP. When given, each span is attributed to the smallest enclosing range (one row per symbol). When omitted (or an empty list), spans are aggregated per source line (one row per line); pass a single whole-file range for a file-level total.

