---@class posthog.tracing.SymbolStatsRow
---@field count number Number of spans attributed to this symbol in the period.
---@field error_count number Spans whose OTel status is Error (status_code = 2).
---@field sum_duration_nano number Total wall-clock span duration in the period, in nanoseconds (additive across spans).
---@field p50_duration_nano number Median wall-clock span duration, in nanoseconds.
---@field p95_duration_nano number 95th-percentile wall-clock span duration, in nanoseconds.
---@field p99_duration_nano number 99th-percentile wall-clock span duration, in nanoseconds.
---@field busy_count number Spans in the period carrying an active/busy time attribute. 0 means busy_* are not meaningful.
---@field p50_busy_nano number Median active (busy) time, in nanoseconds. Excludes awaiting children.
---@field p95_busy_nano number 95th-percentile active (busy) time, in nanoseconds.
---@field p99_busy_nano number 99th-percentile active (busy) time, in nanoseconds.
---@field line number Bucket anchor: the source line (line mode) or the symbol's startLine (symbol mode).
---@field name? string|distilled.Null Echoed name from the requested symbol (symbol mode only).
---@field end_line? number|distilled.Null endLine of the matched symbol's range (symbol mode only).
---@field previous posthog.tracing.SymbolStatsPeriod The same metrics over the immediately-preceding equal-length period.
---@field count_pct_change number|distilled.Null Percentage change in count vs the previous period (180 = +180%). Null when there is no baseline (previous count 0). Use `previous.count` — not a null here — to detect a new symbol.
---@field p95_duration_pct_change number|distilled.Null Percentage change in p95 duration vs the previous period (180 = +180%). Null when the previous p95 is 0 (no comparable baseline), which can occur even when previous.count > 0 — do not read null as 'new symbol'.

